260 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The term "third eye" is used because it represents a unique perceptual ability distinct from the physical senses. Unlike the physical eyes or the brain, the inner eye allows for vivid visualization and creation within the metaphysical realm. This inner faculty enables the user to engage with astral matter, manifest intentional imagery, and visualize depictions of intent within the mental field of consciousness.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
