/K [5]
>>
endobj
263 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The inner eye is not limited to passive visualization. It is capable of shaping astral matter, projecting intent, and enabling perception of non-physical constructs. This ability serves as a bridge to higher dimensions and is integral to activities such as creative problem-solving, lucid dreaming, and astral projection.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
